      "review_summary": "The branch adds `wos-session` to Ollama's session-cookie allowlist, adds manual-header and browser-cookie selector tests, documents WorkOS cookie support, and adds an unreleased changelog note.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-reproducible: current main's Ollama allowlist lacks `wos-session`, and both manual-cookie and imported-cookie selection depend on that predicate. The PR body also includes live terminal output showing the branch accepts and sends a synthetic `wos-session` cookie through the real Ollama/WorkOS redirect path.",
